{:edb/db-before-t 1611 :edb/db-after-t 1612 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534924 50 #inst "2026-10-08T11:09:05.343Z" 13194139534924 true] [17592186059772 1020 #edb/ref 17592186320318 13194139534924 true] [17592186059773 1020 #edb/ref 17592186320321 13194139534924 true] [17592186059774 1020 #edb/ref 17592186320311 13194139534924 true] [17592186320311 1017 #edb/ref 17592186320312 13194139534924 true] [17592186320311 1089 "q-128506" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320311 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534924 true] [17592186320311 1100 "Given that the determinant of\n$[\\begin{aligned}1 & 6 & m \\\\ m & 3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]$\nis $-29$, find all the possible values of $m.$" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320311 1113 #uuid "30a80f14-b653-5ec9-a12d-20d43bb40f91" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320311 1145 "Let's use our formula to find an expression for the determinant in terms of $m:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}1 & 6 & m \\\\ m & 3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}| & =1|\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|-6|\\begin{aligned}m & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}|+m|\\begin{aligned}m & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(3-0)-6(m-0)+m(m-6) \\\\  & =3-6m+{m}^{2}-6m \\\\  & ={m}^{2}-12m+3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the determinant of the matrix is $-29,$ we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}^{2}-12m+3 & =-29 \\\\ {m}^{2}-12m+32 & =0 \\\\ m & =\\frac{-(-12)\\pm \\sqrt{{12}^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 32}}{2\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =\\frac{12\\pm \\sqrt{16}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{12\\pm 4}{2} \\\\  & =6\\pm 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $m=4$ and $m=8.$" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320312 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320313 13194139534924 true] [17592186320312 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320314 13194139534924 true] [17592186320312 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320315 13194139534924 true] [17592186320312 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320316 13194139534924 true] [17592186320312 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320317 13194139534924 true] [17592186320312 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534924 true] [17592186320312 1041 "selection" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320312 1104 #edb/ref 17592186320314 13194139534924 true] [17592186320312 1110 #uuid "653b22c2-ac63-55f3-b4fb-7b1a85208b53" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320313 1034 "$1$ only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320313 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320313 1111 #uuid "d5864ebc-bd7f-518a-ae9b-cfcd1031f011" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320314 1034 "$4$ and $8$ only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320314 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320314 1111 #uuid "e053aafa-15e9-53d8-b693-05a611f29ea3" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320315 1034 "$-5$ and $1$ only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320315 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320315 1111 #uuid "8d870840-8390-59b1-9bf4-6f4cc2c09cf8" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320316 1034 "$8$ only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320316 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320316 1111 #uuid "308cd1c5-fdc4-50d9-a9ee-e91c144ed145" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320317 1034 "$-6$ and $3$ only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320317 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320317 1111 #uuid "d6454265-e507-5721-bd63-f7e365b93e7b" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320318 1017 #edb/ref 17592186320319 13194139534924 true] [17592186320318 1089 "q-280400" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320318 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534924 true] [17592186320318 1100 "If $W=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 1\\end{aligned}],$ then $det(W)=${{field-1}}." 13194139534924 true] [17592186320318 1113 #uuid "dde6084a-f22b-521b-8f63-80fc44758374" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320318 1145 "Using the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 1\\end{aligned}| & =5|\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}|-(-2)|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}|+3|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =5(4\\cdot 1-6\\cdot (-3))+2((-1)(1)-6\\cdot 2)+3((-1)(-3)-4\\cdot 2) \\\\  & =5(4+18)+2(-1-12)+3(3-8) \\\\  & =5(22)+2(-13)+3(-5) \\\\  & =110-26-15 \\\\  & =69\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320319 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320320 13194139534924 true] [17592186320319 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534924 true] [17592186320319 1041 "field-1" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320319 1104 #edb/ref 17592186320320 13194139534924 true] [17592186320319 1110 #uuid "ba0639e0-b406-58d8-8dd8-31ce1bc6e3ba" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320320 1034 "69" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320320 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534924 true] [17592186320320 1111 #uuid "b68a947e-90bb-585f-9170-1a0941101983" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320321 1017 #edb/ref 17592186320322 13194139534924 true] [17592186320321 1089 "q-69834" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320321 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534924 true] [17592186320321 1100 "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $M$ given below?\n\n- $M$ is a singular matrix\n- $det(M)=1$\n- $det(M)=0$\n\n \n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320321 1113 #uuid "d8552c68-18e3-5895-ac27-d2772f0662c0" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320321 1145 "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1|\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -2\\end{aligned}|-(-2)|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{aligned}|+1|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1(-4-12)+2(-2+6)+1(4+4) \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-16)+2\\cdot 4+1\\cdot 8 \\\\  & =-16+8+8 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince $det(M)=0$, the matrix is singular. \n\nTherefore, only statements I and III are true." 13194139534924 true] [17592186320322 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320323 13194139534924 true] [17592186320322 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320324 13194139534924 true] [17592186320322 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320325 13194139534924 true] [17592186320322 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320326 13194139534924 true] [17592186320322 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320327 13194139534924 true] [17592186320322 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534924 true] [17592186320322 1041 "selection" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320322 1104 #edb/ref 17592186320323 13194139534924 true] [17592186320322 1110 #uuid "fcadcf19-fe11-5db7-801e-df274b9bd8ab" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320323 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320323 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320323 1111 #uuid "b701d13a-6d7c-5c2e-af31-553ee940d637" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320324 1034 "I only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320324 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320324 1111 #uuid "c4ca3280-98a6-5a16-8d21-d6e0ea4f6831" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320325 1034 "III only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320325 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320325 1111 #uuid "2cf67513-e616-5396-9606-9a712c18313b" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320326 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320326 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320326 1111 #uuid "56ffd456-b1a8-5482-99ba-d0fd44f28177" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320327 1034 "II only" 13194139534924 true] [17592186320327 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534924 true] [17592186320327 1111 #uuid "0642cdce-55f9-54eb-b634-9b93f16a374e" 13194139534924 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-128506" 17592186320311 "q-128506/selection" 17592186320312 "q-128506/selection/2f817eb15f994caf46175717f58bb0f51c9b451dbd74a973fe420ad3a98f96f2" 175921863